Are your users connecting through a Decserver or similar? Why not try using the
TELNET CREATE_SESSION command to create specific TNAnn: terminal/devices mapped
to ports on the server, then do your checks against that? You could even then
use SYSMAN ALF to specify only certain users can log on from that terminal/port.

Steve Spires

